# Input

```vue
<template>
  <a-long-long-long-element>foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar</a-long-long-long-element>
  <span>short content</span>
</template>

<template><a-long-long-long-element
>foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar</a-long-long-long-element
><span
>short content</span
></template>

```


# Formatted

```vue
<template>
	<a-long-long-long-element
		>foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo
		bar</a-long-long-long-element
	>
	<span>short content</span>
</template>

<template
	><a-long-long-long-element
		>foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo bar foo
		bar</a-long-long-long-element
	><span>short content</span></template
>

```
